(?>a+)b  SyntaxError
a++b     SyntaxError
a*+b     SyntaxError
a?+b     SyntaxError
a+a                    on "aa"           -> "aa"
(?=(a+))\1a            on "aa"           -> no match
(?=(a+))\1b            on "aab"          -> "aab"
^[\w.]+\.com$          on "example.com"  -> "example.com"
^(?=([\w.]+))\1\.com$  on "example.com"  -> no match
